        "review_title": "Perfect for 4 pin led strip lighting with a little bit of soldering skills.",
        "rating": 5,
        "review_text": "I used this wire to run under cabinet lighting in my kitchen. It's the right gauge and it was easy to work with. I had my fiance help me fish the wire down into the basement and we fished it up another wall quite quickly and easily. I soldered the ends to the connectors provided by the lighting kit and everything turned out as I expected it to. I recently added a motion sensor on one set of lights and bought a second motion sensor for the other set of cabinet lights. The price, the quality and the quantity of the wire was more than enough for my project. I'm sure when one of my customers discovers that I can do this they will want it done in their home as well. I just love the way it makes everything look and I was extremely happy to be able to purchase this product without leaving my home!\nRead more",
